room test/chasm
# Tech 2's gap: 1664 u (52 tiles) from the near edge at 480 u to the far ledge at 2144 u. The
# far ledge's face is smooth below its lip and the gap is 1504 u deep: nothing in it can be
# clung to, pogoed off or climbed out of toward the far side (movement review 4, H1), so only
# a route that reaches the far ledge from the air crosses. The farthest route without a
# dash-jump of any kind reaches 1595 u, 59 u short of the 1654 u a crossing needs (docs/adr/0010;
# tools/replay/gap_reach.gd).
size 80 60
spawn 300 384
